WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.869
(table clanging)

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.144
(eerie music)

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:19.619
- This is him.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.689
Yes, it's him.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.491
- I'm very sorry, sir.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.425
- Hold on a second.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.294
Wait,

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.031
is this him?

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.867 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Take your time,
sir. There's no rush.

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.002
- Yes, yes, yes.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:36.970
It's definitely him.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.238
- Okay.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
- So if you make your way,
- Wait.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.043
- It seems like him.

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:46.813
Yes, yes,
- Okay.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.548
- It very much could be him.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.820 align:start size:88% position:13%
(man clears throat)
- So this, this is him?

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.523
- Although, hmm.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.959
Let me just,

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.695
(sheets rustling)

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:06.232
- Okay. I'm sorry.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:07.500
Sir, I know that you're blind,

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.536
but you're gonna have
to make a decision.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:10.970
- Oh, I'm not blind.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.872
- Oh, thank God.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.873
I'm not a mortician.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.810
- And I'm not dead,

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.611
but please don't
stop on my account.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.554
(pants unzipping)

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:30.023
(man breathing heavily)

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:30.857
- Shh.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.393
- It's definitely not him.

